msgctxt "SettingsPage"
msgid "Warn when a page isn't the site a password belongs to"
msgstr ""

#: ui/pages.slint:3631
msgctxt "SettingsPage"
msgid ""
"When you paste or send the password of one of your logins on another site, "
"or open a sign-in page that only looks like a site you have a login for "
"(paypa1.com for paypal.com), the extension says so in the page and names the "
"site. This app compares, from your vault's own sites; nothing is downloaded "
"and the extension keeps nothing. Logins behind the item lock are never "
"compared. The emergency kit's keys are refused in every page either way."
msgstr ""

