"read its files. JSON, CSV and Credential Exchange are NOT encrypted: anyone "
"who gets the file can read every password (and, from a Credential Exchange "
"file, sign in with your passkeys), and malware looks for exactly these "
"files. Use them only to move to another password manager, then delete the "
"file."
